[2.122, "o", "\r\n== 5. move the stack to ak-offgrid-site (internal: no gateway)\r\n"]
[2.597, "o", "\u001b[4m>>>> Executing external compose provider \"/usr/libexec/docker/cli-plugins/docker-compose\". Please see podman-compose(1) for how to disable this message. <<<<\r\n\r\n\u001b[0m"]
